title Trends & Insights - Focus Group Evaluator (Single LLM Agent)

package "Inputs" {
  [Final Commercial (MP4)] as Video
  [Campaign Brief] as Brief
  [Ad Copy / Concept] as Concept
}

package "Focus Group Evaluator Agent" {
  component "Single LLM Agent" as Agent {
    [Gemini 3 Flash Preview] as LLM
    [Text Evaluation] as TextEval
  }

  component "Simulated Panelists" as Simulator {
    actor "Panelist 1 (Gen Z)" as P1
    actor "Panelist 2 (Millennial)" as P2
    actor "Panelist 3 (Eco-Conscious)" as P3
  }
}

package "Scoring & Output" {
  [Weighted Scoring Matrix] as Matrix
  [Go/No-Go Decision] as Decision
  [Focus Group Summary] as Report
}

note right of Agent
  Single LLM agent simulates
  3-person focus group with
  text-based evaluation
  (thinking_level="LOW")
end note

' Relationships
Video --> Agent : Input
Brief --> Agent : Context
Concept --> Agent : Context

Agent --> TextEval : 1. Analyze
TextEval --> Simulator : 2. Simulate Panelists

Simulator --> Matrix : 3. Collect Scores

Matrix --> Decision : 4. Evaluate (Threshold 7.0+)
Decision --> Report : 5. Generate

P1 ..> Matrix : Score
P2 ..> Matrix : Score
P3 ..> Matrix : Score

@endum
